# ── Sections ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   1. AI agents      5. Editors & OS    9. Project-specific
#   2. Secrets        6. Scratch & logs  10. Re-includes
#   3. Python (uv)    7. Binaries        11. Final invariants — keep last
#   4. Node / Bun     8. Other stacks
#
#   Order is load-bearing: last match wins, so each section overrides the ones
#   above it. Paste foreign templates into section 8, never at the end.
#   Mixed folder: `dir/*` + `!dir/keeper`, never `dir/` + `!dir/keeper`
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── AI agents ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/*
.codex/*
.agents/

