# ── Rust / Tauri ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `target/` alone already matches at any depth (frontend/src-tauri/target/).
# `**/` is only needed when the pattern itself contains a slash, like the next one.
target/
**/src-tauri/gen/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
rustc-ice-*.txt

